{
  "analysis": "I now have the key VM details: it loads .text/.data/.rodata sections, starts at `main`, uses little-endian MIPS, and supports a subset of MIPS32 instructions. Syscalls use non-standard numbers (0=read, 1=write, 2=open, 3=close, 8=lseek, 201=time) with arguments in $a0-$a2 and return in $v0. handleSyscall always returns 0 so syscalls don't terminate the program. I need to build a freestanding MIPSel ELF with a custom minimal libc since standard glibc syscalls won't match.",
  "plan": "First, do a test compile of all Doom source files with the MIPSel cross compiler using freestanding flags to identify all undefined symbols. This will tell me exactly what minimal libc functions I need to implement. I'll replace doomgeneric_xlib.c with doomgeneric_img.c.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cd /app/doomgeneric/doomgeneric && ls *.c | sort | tr '\\n' ' ' && echo\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cd /app/doomgeneric/doomgeneric && mkdir -p build_mips && for f in *.c; do if [ \"$f\" != \"doomgeneric_xlib.c\" ] && [ \"$f\" != \"doomgeneric_sdl.c\" ] && [ \"$f\" != \"doomgeneric_allegro.c\" ] && [ \"$f\" != \"doomgeneric_emscripten.c\" ] && [ \"$f\" != \"doomgeneric_soso.c\" ] && [ \"$f\" != \"doomgeneric_sosox.c\" ] && [ \"$f\" != \"doomgeneric_win.c\" ] && [ \"$f\" != \"doomgeneric_xlib.c\" ]; then mipsel-linux-gnu-gcc -c -O2 -EL -march=mips32 -mno-abicalls -fno-pic -ffreestanding -nostdlib -fno-builtin -Wall -DNORMALUNIX -DLINUX -DSNDSERV -D_DEFAULT_SOURCE \"$f\" -o \"build_mips/${f%.c}.o\" 2>&1 | head -5; fi; done; echo \"Compile done\"\n",
      "duration": 10.0
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cd /app/doomgeneric/doomgeneric && mipsel-linux-gnu-gcc -c -O2 -EL -march=mips32 -mno-abicalls -fno-pic -ffreestanding -nostdlib -fno-builtin -Wall -DNORMALUNIX -DLINUX -DSNDSERV -D_DEFAULT_SOURCE doomgeneric_img.c -o build_mips/doomgeneric_img.o 2>&1 | head -20; echo \"img compile done\"\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cd /app/doomgeneric/doomgeneric && mipsel-linux-gnu-ld -EL -m elf32ltsmip -nostdlib -o /tmp/doomgeneric_test build_mips/*.o 2>&1 | head -100; echo \"Link test done\"\n",
      "duration": 1.0
    }
  ]
}
